WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.826
- So what's our plan?

00:00:01.826 --> 00:00:04.409
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.942 --> 00:00:08.920
- Leave it to Disney to
turn something as boring-

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.540
sounding as "Investor's Day"

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.030
into the content equivalent of Christmas.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.060
From TV shows, new movies,
and casting announcements,

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.330
Disney announced a slew
of all things Marvel

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.080
to add even more to the
next phase of the MCU.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.480
But what does this all mean
for you and I, friends?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.370
Well, don't worry we're gonna
break it all down for you

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.720
right now on The Ketchup.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.670
- Disney dropped an
Infinity Gauntlet-sized mic

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.590
when it revealed huge slates of content,

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.070
including everything from Lucasfilm to FX

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.080
to Hulu, Pixar, and Marvel.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.380
And while we could talk
for hours about the news

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:39.630
from Disney's Investor Day,

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.350
today we're setting our sights on Marvel

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.170
and three of the bigger
stories from the day,

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.060
starting with everyone's
favorite bad boy from Asgard.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.810
- I'm gonna burn this place to the ground.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.020
- Fans Got their first look at "Loki,"

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.650
the new Disney plus series
that promises to reveal what

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.090
really happened to MCU's reformed villain.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.620
Though Tom Hiddleston's
character died by Thanos' hand

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.640
in "Infinity War,"

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.170
the trickster demigod
managed to escape his fate

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.170
during the events of
the movie's time heist

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:05.290
when his past self grabbed the Tesseract

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.680
and transported to places unknown.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.300
Now the trailer doesn't give much away

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.150
besides Owen Wilson's
awesome silver fox makeover

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:13.460
as a member of the TVA,

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.450
which stands for the
Time Variance Authority,

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.680
a multi-verse agency

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.910
tasked with keeping
Marvel's timelines safe

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:21.250
from meddling forces.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.580
Now, we don't know where
the TVA is located,

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.070
but from the trailer, we're
guessing an alternate dimension

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.570
where the sky is orange,

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:28.770
time moves differently,

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:31.820
and the identity of mysterious
1960s plane hijacker

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.680
D.B. Cooper may have just been solved.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.540
So look for "Loki" on
a small screen near you

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.840
in May of 2021.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:38.673
- Glorious.

00:01:38.673 --> 00:01:40.890
- Though Captain America
has retired the mantle

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.420
and shield, the adventure is far from over

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.000
in "Falcon and the Winter Soldier."

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.260
Premiering on March 19th on Disney+,

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:48.810
Anthony Mackie and Sebastian Stan

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:50.520
reprise their Avengers roles

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.100
as Sam Wilson and Bucky Barnes

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.720
as they fight some old enemies,

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.860
like Daniel Brühl's Baron
Zemo, as well as some new faces

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.270
like John Walker, A.K.A. US agent,

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.560
played by MCU newcomer Wyatt Russell.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.840
And the team-up is promised to reinvent

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.630
some of what we know from the MCU,

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:08.180
but will they be able to
put aside their differences

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.630
to fight international terrorists

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.110
while keeping up that witty banter?

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:12.229
We shall wait and see.

00:02:12.229 --> 00:02:13.510
- God, I hate you.

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:15.470
- Last but not least,
Disney also announced that

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:18.560
it's gonna take another stab
at a Fantastic Four movie.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:21.040
So far, Marvel hasn't had much luck

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.570
at getting Reed Richards and his crew

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.520
into the same hall of fame
as the Avengers or X-Men

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.550
despite two different takes on
the story in the last decade.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:29.750
But you know who else needed

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.540
three big-screen tries
before making their crossover

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.470
into the MCU?

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:34.860
That's right: Peter Parker.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.670
Which is why Jon Watts, director
of "Spider-Man: Homecoming"

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.240
and "Spider-Man: Far From Home,"

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.910
will be heading up the new film,

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:43.570
and our spidey senses are just tingling.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.220
And now that the Fab Four will officially

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.990
be an MCU property under Disney,

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.200
we can expect Johnny Storm
to be hanging with Hawkeye

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.750
in no time.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.380
I mean, who knows? Maybe
the Hulk and the Thing

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:53.660
could raid each other's closets.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.500
Weirder things have happened.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.760
- I think it's gratuitous, but whatever.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.460
- Disney also announced a
ton of other Marvel news

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:02.570
about "Black Widow,"
"WandaVision," "Ms. Marvel,"

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.900
"She-Hulk," "Hawkeye," "Moon Knight,"

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.310
and the first animated series, "What if."

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.143
Alright friends,

00:03:08.143 --> 00:03:09.640
it's time for us to kick
it over to you, now.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.820
Are you excited by all
these announcements?

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:12.720
Are you overwhelmed?

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.680
Do you think Disney is biting
off more than they can chew?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.460
Please let us know all
your thoughts and feelings

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.340
in the comments section.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.930
I don't know why I just did jazz hands,

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.320
but let us know also what
you're most looking forward to

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.040
that's coming up in the MCU.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.100
And don't worry, we got
some more Disney updates

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.110
as far as Star Wars and Pixar coming soon,

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:29.410
so stay tuned for that.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.510
As always, can't thank you
enough for watching The Ketchup.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.580
My name's Naz Perez, and
we hope to see your face

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.470
in the next video.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.551
Bye.

00:03:35.551 --> 00:03:38.134
